---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="百部 · CamEllya">
  <nav class="nav">
    <a href="/" class="nav-logo">康予纳安</a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="/explore">到处看看</a>
      <a href="/camellya" class="nav-active">CamEllya</a>
      <a href="/about">关于我</a>
    </div>
  </nav>
  <main class="page-main">
    <a href="/camellya" class="back">← 返回 CamEllya</a>
    <div class="char-layout">
      <div class="char-left">
        <img src="/images/camellya/baibu.png" alt="百部" class="char-avatar" />
        <div class="char-name-card">
          <div class="char-name">百部</div>
          <div class="char-role" style="color:#C4935A">主音吉他 · 小青龙</div>
        </div>
        <div class="char-tags">
          <span class="tag">乐观</span>
          <span class="tag">阳光</span>
          <span class="tag">治愈</span>
          <span class="tag">吉他</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="char-right">
        <h1 class="page-title">百部</h1>
        <div class="char-section">
          <div class="section-label">基本设定</div>
          <p>百部是一条小青龙，CamEllya 乐队的主音吉他手。乐观开朗，阳光灿烂，像小孩子一样天真烂漫，总能在不经意间治愈身边的人。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="char-section">
          <div class="section-label">性格特质</div>
          <p>天然去雕饰的快乐，对世界充满好奇和热情。和他在一起，会莫名其妙地被他的能量感染，连烦恼都变得轻盈了。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="char-section">
          <div class="section-label">乐器</div>
          <p>电吉他，主音吉他。他的演奏充满能量和感染力，是乐队最耀眼的那道光。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="char-section">
          <div class="section-label">关系</div>
          <p>晴舒的兄弟，两人从小一起长大，默契深厚。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <footer class="footer"><span>© 2026 CamEllya</span><span class="footer-dot">百部 ✦</span></footer>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
:root{--bg:#F2F4F6;--surface:#fff;--blue:#4AACDB;--text:#1a1a1a;--muted:#666;--hint:#aaa;--border:#e0e4ea}
.nav{background:var(--surface);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px 32px;border-bottom:0.5px solid var(--border)}
.nav-logo{font-size:15px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text);text-decoration:none}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:22px}
.nav-links a{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--blue)}
.nav-active{color:var(--blue)!important;font-weight:500}
.page-main{max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 32px}
.back{font-size:13px;color:var(--blue);text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:28px}
.char-layout{display:flex;gap:48px;align-items:flex-start}
.char-left{flex-shrink:0;width:220px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:14px;position:sticky;top:32px}
.char-avatar{width:220px;height:220px;border-radius:16px;object-fit:cover;border:0.5px solid var(--border)}
.char-name-card{text-align:center}
.char-name{font-size:18px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text)}
.char-role{font-size:12px;margin-top:4px}
.char-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;justify-content:center}
.tag{font-size:11px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;background:#F5F0E8;border:0.5px solid #E8D8C0;color:#C4935A}
.char-right{flex:1}
.page-title{font-size:26px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:28px}
.char-section{margin-bottom:24px}
.section-label{font-size:11px;font-weight:500;color:#999;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px}
.char-section p{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.9}
.footer{background:var(--surface);padding:14px 32px;border-top:0.5px solid var(--border);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:var(--hint);margin-top:40px}
.footer-dot{color:#C4935A}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .nav-links { gap: 12px; }
  .nav-links a { font-size: 12px; }
  .page-main { padding: 28px 16px; }
  .char-layout { flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
  .char-left { width: 100%; position: static; }
  .char-avatar { width: 160px; height: 160px; }
  .char-section p { font-size: 14px; }
}
</style>